{"unit_id":"tag:03AQ:statement","translation":"由等式（<REF_0001>）给出的函子（functor）是正合（exact）函子（functor）（见《同调（Homology）》引理<REF_0002>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"等式定义的函子；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"函子的正合性；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调","context":"引用的章节标题；词表尚未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03AQ:proof","translation":"对于任意对象（object）<MATH_0001>（属于<MATH_0002>），函子（functor）<MATH_0003>是从<MATH_0004>到<MATH_0005>的加性（additive）正合（exact）函子（functor）。项（terms）<MATH_0006>属于该复形（complex），是这些正合（exact）函子（functors）的积（products），因而正合（exact）。此外，复形（complexes）的序列（sequence）正合（exact），当且仅当给定次数（degree）的项（terms）的序列（sequence）正合（exact）。因此引理成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"additive","target_term":"加性"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"范畴中的对象；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"对象上的取值函子；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"additive","target_term":"加性","context":"取值函子的加性；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"函子或序列的正合性；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项","context":"复形在各次的项；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"由取值函子构成的复形；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"构成复形各项的函子；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"积","context":"正合函子的积；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"所讨论的序列中的复形；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列","context":"复形或各次项的序列；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数","context":"复形的给定次数；词表尚未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03AR:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为范畴（category）。设<MATH_0002>为具有固定靶（target）的态射族（family of morphisms），使得所有纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>中存在。函子（functors）<MATH_0005>构成<MATH_0006>-函子（functor），从阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）<MATH_0007>到<MATH_0008>-模（modules）的范畴（category）（见《同调（Homology）》定义<REF_0001>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"引理的起始范畴和目标范畴；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶","context":"态射族的共同目标；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"固定目标的一族态射；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"假设存在的纤维积；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子","context":"各次上同调给出的函子；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"delta函子的结构；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴","context":"delta函子的来源范畴；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"delta函子的目标范畴中的模；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调","context":"引用的章节标题；词表尚未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03AR:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>，阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）的短正合列（short exact sequence）<MATH_0001>被变成复形（complexes）的短正合列（short exact sequence），其项为<MATH_0002>-模（modules）。因此，我们可以利用《同调（Homology）》引理<REF_0002>得到边界映射（boundary maps）<MATH_0003>以及相应的长正合列（exact sequence）。我们略去对这些映射（maps）与预层（presheaves）的短正合列（short exact sequences）之间的映射（maps）相容的验证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"boundary maps","target_term":"边界映射"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"长正合列"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"short exact sequences","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔","context":"预层的阿贝尔性质；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"短正合列中的预层；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列","context":"预层或复形的短正合列；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"模构成的复形；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"复形中各项的模；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调","context":"引用的章节标题；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"boundary maps","target_term":"边界映射","context":"由短正合列得到的边界映射；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"长正合列","context":"原文此处限定为long exact sequence；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"边界映射和短正合列之间的映射；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"short exact sequences","target_term":"短正合列","context":"相容性所涉及的短正合列；词表尚未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03AS:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为范畴（category）。设<MATH_0002>为具有固定靶（target）的态射族（family of morphisms），使得所有纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0003>在<MATH_0004>中存在。考虑链（chain）复形（complex）<MATH_0005>，其项为阿贝尔（abelian）预层（presheaves）：<MATH_0006>，其中最后一个非零项（term）置于次数（degree）<MATH_0007>，而映射（map）<MATH_0008>由典范映射（canonical map）的<MATH_0009>倍给出。则存在同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0010>，关于<MATH_0011>具有函子性（functorial）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"chain","target_term":"链"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"term","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"存在所需纤维积的范畴；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"靶","context":"态射族的固定目标；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"用于构造复形的态射族；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"构造复形所用的纤维积；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"chain","target_term":"链","context":"chain complex的链结构；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"阿贝尔预层的复形；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔","context":"复形中的预层性质；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"链复形的各项；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"term","target_term":"项","context":"复形最后一个非零项；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"degree","target_term":"次数","context":"最后一个非零项所在的次数；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"复形中指定的映射；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"确定微分的典范映射；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"引理给出的同构；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性","context":"同构关于指定变量的函子性；词表尚未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
